      "tips": [
        {
          "id": "adc:KogMaw:general:0",
          "text": "Turn on Bio-Arcane Barrage to hit enemies from outside their range. It also hurts tanky targets, since it deals damage based on their max Health.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "KogMaw-W", "start": 8, "end": 26 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.36
        },
        {
          "id": "adc:KogMaw:general:1",
          "text": "Cast Void Ooze on enemies who walk toward you. They are slowed, which makes Living Artillery easier to land.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "KogMaw-E", "start": 5, "end": 14 },
            { "kind": "keyword", "key": "slowed", "start": 56, "end": 62 },
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "KogMaw-R", "start": 76, "end": 92 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.1
        },
        {
          "id": "adc:KogMaw:general:2",
          "text": "Fire Living Artillery at enemies who are low on Health. It hits much harder against them, and it works well to finish a fight.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "KogMaw-R", "start": 5, "end": 21 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.02
        },
        {
          "id": "adc:KogMaw:general:3",
          "text": "Watch your Mana when you fire Living Artillery over and over. Each shot in a quick row costs more.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "KogMaw-R", "start": 30, "end": 46 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.01
        },
        {
          "id": "adc:KogMaw:general:4",
          "text": "Open a trade with Caustic Spittle. It strips the target's Armor and Magic Resist, so your follow-up damage hurts more.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "KogMaw-Q", "start": 18, "end": 33 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.04
        },
        {
          "id": "adc:KogMaw:general:5",
          "text": "Stay behind your front line, because you have no escape. Enemies who get on top of you will kill you.",
          "refs": [],
          "pWrong": 0.49
        },
        {
          "id": "adc:KogMaw:general:6",
          "text": "If you die, walk your Icathian Surprise zombie toward enemies. It explodes after a few seconds and can kill careless enemies.",
          "refs": [
            {
              "kind": "ability",
              "key": "KogMaw-passive",
              "start": 22,
              "end": 39
            }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.72
        }
      ],
      "combos": []
    }
  ],
